{
  "name": "FraudNova phone enrichment (Google Sheets)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### How it works\nEnriches a Google Sheet of phone numbers with FraudNova. When a new row is added, the workflow checks the number in its `phone` column (and the optional `country` column) and writes `valid`, `line_type`, `carrier`, `fraud_score`, `risky`, `checked_at` and `status` back to the row. It helps anyone cleaning a lead or contact list before an SMS or call campaign.\nLimits: rows are matched on `phone`, so a duplicate number updates the first match. The `phone` column must be plain text (or include `+` and the country code) so leading zeros are not lost. A failed check writes `status` = `error`.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a Header Auth credential named `FraudNova API`: header `Authorization`, value **`Bearer ` + space + your key** (key at https://fraudnova.com/dashboard/api-keys). New accounts get 25 free credits; each check costs 1 credit.\n2. Open **Settings** and set `default_country` (for example `US`) for rows without a `country` value.\n3. Select your Google Sheets credential, and pick the same document and sheet in both Google Sheets nodes. The sheet needs the header columns `phone`, `country` (optional), `valid`, `line_type`, `carrier`, `fraud_score`, `risky`, `checked_at` and `status`.\n\n### Customization\nSwap Google Sheets for Airtable or a CRM node by replacing the first and last nodes and keeping *Check phone* in the middle.\n\nTemplates and docs: https://github.com/dahleedam/fraudnova-examples/tree/main/examples/n8n",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -940,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New row\nA new row starts the run.\nSettings holds the default country.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Section: New row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -340,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Check the phone number\n1 credit per row.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Section: Check the phone number",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        130,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Write results back\nThe row is matched on phone.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Section: Write results back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        390,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Pick the same document and sheet as the trigger",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 3
      },
      "name": "Warning: document and sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "event": "rowAdded",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Google Sheets Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -300,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsTriggerOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Sheets Trigger account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "setting-1",
              "name": "default_country",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -60,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://fraudnova.com/api/v1/check/phone",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ ($('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.phone || '').toString().replace(/[^0-9+\\-\\s()]/g, '') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "country",
              "value": "={{ ($('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.country || $('Settings').item.json.default_country || '').toString().trim() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "name": "Check phone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "FraudNova API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
